  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 11th level, a dreamguard can crush a world egg and scatter the dust. This causes all creatures within a 30 foot cone to make a Will save (DC 10 + 1/2 dreamguard level + Charisma modifier) or fall asleep. While using this the dreamguard can select 1 effective dream to give to anyone who fails the save.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/dreamguard#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
